 "_replacement_doc": "Same-brand replacement (spec v1.8 10g.32 item 4, amended): the old unit's readings carry the same source id, so all history from that source would include data from before the event -> handoff (unresolved_temporal_phrase). A replacement word, or a model or version next to the device ('Ring 4', 'Whoop 4.0', 'Whoop MG', 'Gen 3'), marks it.",
